{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act30side_level_act30side_02_end",
  "groupId": "act30side",
  "stageId": "act30side_02",
  "title": "同车异图",
  "storyCode": "RS-2",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act30side/level_act30side_02_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "7e6419d61b391b4ba93bb2e8a97e9829490fec2894954de5641494fb93a2648c",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精神的游客",
      "text": "快看，外面能看到雪山！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精神的游客",
      "text": "天啊这也太近了吧，这是不是谢拉格的圣山？不管是不是，这景色都太美了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发抖的游客",
      "text": "我、我说啊，能不能先把窗户关上......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精神的游客",
      "text": "欸？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发抖的游客",
      "text": "风、风有点大，吹得我说话都、都有点不利索了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精神的游客",
      "text": "也不至于这么夸张吧，我觉得也不是不能忍忍......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发抖的游客",
      "text": "真的假的，你真的不冷吗？我看你甚至没穿裤子——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精神的游客",
      "text": "建议你再组织一下语言，再这么说下去我就要告你耍流氓了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精神的游客",
      "text": "我穿的这是保暖裤袜，最厚实的那一种！比你那身暖和多了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发抖的游客",
      "text": "哎哟......行行行，你说是，那就是吧......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精神的游客",
      "text": "哼。快，你再站过来点，我要拍照了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发抖的游客",
      "text": "......嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发抖的游客",
      "text": "哎，你有没有听到什么声音......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "女士们先生们，日安，日安！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "很抱歉打扰各位的观光休闲！麻烦各位暂时回到坐席稍作避让，我们——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "行了这种时候了就别废话了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "对不住各位，让让，麻烦都让让！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "罗莎琳！这样有点太失礼了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "哎，哎，罗莎琳，轻点拉，我的袖子要被你扯下来了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精神的游客",
      "text": "呃，这是什么谢拉格风俗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精神的游客",
      "text": "我们也要这样在列车里跑跑看吗......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发抖的游客",
      "text": "不可能有这种风俗吧？感觉好傻，我不干。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精神的游客",
      "text": "不管了，还是先把合照拍了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精神的游客",
      "text": "看镜头！三......二......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精神的游客",
      "text": "一......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "我不讨厌这种追逐游戏。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "我谈不上喜欢。我们不能坐下来好好谈吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "是你们自己做贼心虚，一直在跑啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "最好继续跑，别停下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "哦，顺便一说，再等五分钟才是外面风景最好的路段，合影可以之后再拍。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "玩得开心点。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精神的游客",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发抖的游客",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精神的游客",
      "text": "刚刚那又是什么人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发抖的游客",
      "text": "不知道......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发抖的游客",
      "text": "不过你刚刚说得可能有道理，谢拉格搞不好确实有什么要在列车上疾跑一圈的风俗......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发抖的游客",
      "text": "我们，呃，要不然还是入乡随俗......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精神的游客",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发抖的游客",
      "text": "你怎么了，从刚刚起在发什么呆？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精神的游客",
      "text": "我的照片，我的照片！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发抖的游客",
      "text": "照片怎么了？刚刚那人说再过五分钟风景更好，我看我们还是再等等看......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精神的游客",
      "text": "不是说这个！你看这张照片！我正好拍到刚刚那位姐姐的正脸了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精神的游客",
      "text": "我总感觉她看起来有点眼熟，好像在哪见过......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精神的游客",
      "text": "算了不重要！重点是她、她这身正装，未免也太帅了吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精神的游客",
      "text": "我要珍藏这张照片！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好客的老乡",
      "text": "我来给大家介绍一下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好客的老乡",
      "text": "这就是我们谢拉格最有名的奶酪锅，用的是我们当地特产的好奶酪，风味醇厚，保管谢拉格之外的地方都没有这样的滋味！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好奇的游客",
      "text": "真有这么好？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "快快，再快点！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "等、等等，罗莎琳......呃咳咳咳！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "失礼了女士们先生们，奶酪锅的味道确实不错，我推荐加点胡椒风味更浓——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好客的老乡",
      "text": "什、什么人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好客的老乡",
      "text": "怎么还来？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好奇的游客",
      "text": "......这就是谢拉格的列车旅行吗，果然如我的朋友们说的那样，别有特色。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好奇的游客",
      "text": "呀，加了胡椒果然不错，我喜欢这个味道！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格老乡",
      "text": "哎，齐了，抓齐了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格老乡",
      "text": "托各位的福，羽兽一只都没少。劳动各位帮忙，真不知道怎么感谢才好......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列车员",
      "text": "老先生，您可把袋子系紧咯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列车员",
      "text": "这次......这次就算了，但您千万记好，我们的列车上是禁止带活物的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列车员",
      "text": "下次记得一定不能再这样了啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格老乡",
      "text": "哎，一定的，一定的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格老乡",
      "text": "哦、哦哟，小年轻，什么事情这么紧急啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列车员",
      "text": "客、客人！列车上请不要这样奔跑！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格老乡",
      "text": "哎！那个戴帽子的家伙！你仔细点......你，哎！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格老乡",
      "text": "要命了，我的羽兽！我的羽兽又跑啦！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烦恼的游客",
      "text": "这个盲盒怎么老是抽不到隐藏限量款！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烦恼的游客",
      "text": "最后一次，最后再试一次......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烦恼的游客",
      "text": "嘿！走路注意点！万一撞坏了我的盲盒......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烦恼的游客",
      "text": "啊！是、是限量款！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "终点。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "最后一节车厢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "追逐游戏结束？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "女士，您赢得了游戏，这看起来已经没有悬念。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "我希望我们能......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "聒噪。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "我的时间不多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "“灰礼帽”，别着急，我会记得你有这份恳谈的意愿。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "回头我再单独和你“谈谈”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "现在。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "自己出来，别让我动手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "咳、咳咳。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "这位大姐，姐！我在这呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "咳咳，呸，地上还挺多灰......美女姐姐，你找我有事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "我找的不是你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "可是这除了我没别人......\n哎哟！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "（你别乱动！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "......你们在演什么戏？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "什、什么演戏？没没没有的事！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "（哎大叔你安静点！我这不正在替你遮掩呢嘛！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "（别、别扯我的头发！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "你是罗德岛的人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "啊？我确实是......你知道罗德岛？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "欸，美女姐姐，难道你是博士上次来认识的熟人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "熟人？我不是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "好了，我没有太多时间闲聊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "在我耐心耗尽之前，出来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "（小祖宗，算了算了，快放我出来吧！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "哈啊......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "你能这样帮我确实令我感动，但罗莎琳你下手也太重了点......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "嘶......我的头发，我的胡子啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "终于找到你了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "怎么，原来你们认识？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "咳，咳嗯。\n不敢说相识，不过也曾有过几面之缘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "锏女士，许久不见，让您见笑了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "寒暄就不必了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "克雷加文，山上的老雷昂急着找你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "......老雷昂？找我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "等会，是老雷昂找我，而不是锏女士您要找我......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "我受他所托，来找你。一回事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "他如此着急找我，是有何要事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "这么说来，我好像确实忘了点什么......是什么来着......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "你忘了莉莉还在等你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "......对了，是莉莉！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "什么莉莉......不是吧，大叔，你把你相好的忘了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "相好——？！\n不是，咳咳，咳——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "......子爵阁下，您如此行事，恐怕有损维多利亚的形象。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "尊夫人和令千金如果知道此事......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "呜哇，人渣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "慢着！咳咳，该死的灰，不是！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "莉莉是——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "各位乘客，本次列车即将到达终点站——\n银心湖站。\n请各位乘客收拾好随身的行李物品，从各自车厢前后车门有序下车。\n感谢您乘坐本次列车。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "时间耽搁得还不算久。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "下车后你最好尽快上山去找老雷昂，他很急。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "我们还是分道扬镳吧，不然我妈会不高兴的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "不，咳咳，莉莉——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "——她根本就不是人啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "你还要骂人家不是人？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "不不不不。噗，得了，把我自己气笑了。岔气了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "莉莉是驮兽。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "驮兽......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "原来如此。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "......我没说吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "“灰礼帽”！你装什么呢！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "我不信你手下的探子没把我在谢拉格的行动汇报给你！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "很抱歉，您治愈的驮兽叫什么名字，并不在需要我记忆的重点情报之中，阁下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "......所以，其实大叔不是人渣，也不会有什么危险？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "又追又跑的，我以为是什么性命攸关的大事呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "我......唉！罗莎琳，这确实是事关我名誉的大事啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "你们想磨蹭多久？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "别傻站着，挡路。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "车到站了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
